            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1230" n="1175" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v17/pg1175"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1969-76v17">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume
                    XVII</ref>, China, 1969–1972. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been
                    revised. <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#pg848">Document 212, Footnote 1, Page
                                848</ref> (date of correction: October 14, 2012)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The conversation number in the document’s source note has been corrected
                        from “No. 532–17” to “No. 683–4.”</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. <ref target="#pg652">Document 185, Footnote 2, Page
                                652</ref> (date of correction: January 3, 2013)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The footnote of the referenced document has been corrected from “footnote
                        14” to “footnote 12.”</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">3. <ref target="#pg793">Document 200, Footnote 5, Page
                                793</ref> (date of correction: January 3, 2013)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The footnote of the referenced document has been corrected from “footnote
                        16” to “footnote 15.”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
